{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Cost-Adjusted Network Model Selection.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Cost-Adjusted Network Model Selection.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"cost adjusted network model selection cost adjusted network model selection","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Cost-Adjusted Network Model Selection.md","fileName":"Cost-Adjusted Network Model Selection.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Cost-Adjusted Network Model Selection","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 18:30\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Network Copilot Design]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Network Copilot Design","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Cost-Adjusted Network Model Selection.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Cost-Adjusted Network Model Selection.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"cost adjusted network model selection cost adjusted network model selection","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Cost-Adjusted Network Model Selection.md","fileName":"Cost-Adjusted Network Model Selection.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Cost-Adjusted Network Model Selection","heading":"Cost-Adjusted Network Model Selection","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Cost-adjusted network model selection combines measured response quality with the price of using each model. Averaging evaluation scores shows relative performance across question categories, while a cost factor reveals whether a small improvement justifies a materially more expensive default.\n\nThe weighting must reflect operational consequences. A troubleshooting assistant used rarely may favor quality, while a high-volume explanatory service may value economy and latency. Selection is revisited when prompts, prices, models, or task mix change; it is not a permanent property of the model